#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""v84: v52-anchored joint innovation-field audit and causal correction.

This runner tests the remaining joint-field hypothesis without using a
retrospective candidate selector:

    v52 anchor for every cell
    + causal history of already observed one-step v52 innovations
    -> shared Hodge/RBF residual field
    -> causal field forecast
    -> bounded joint correction for h1..h6.

The implementation is deliberately strict:

* training innovations are generated by movie-level out-of-fold v52 models;
* validation/test innovations are generated by the final train-movie model;
* target/future residuals are used only as supervised labels and diagnostics;
* hard time-shuffle, wrong-movie and randomized-position controls are reported;
* component RMSE and Euclidean vector RMSE are both emitted, because historical
  v52 and v81/v83 reports used different RMSE conventions.
"""

